{
  "name": "dsh-ufo",
  "version": "0.4.9",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "你太习惯这个世界了，才会对任何事情都不感到惊奇，慢慢失去了对世界与生俱来的好奇心。\n\n美国空军蓝皮书（1947–1969，12,618 起）、法国 GEIPAN 的三千余宗案卷、英国国防部 DEFE 24、巴西国家档案馆，以及 NUFORC 的十六万条民间目击——一个入口都调得到。按国家、年份、形状或关键词问，同一事件的多方记录自动合并，每条官方解释都标明出处。你查过的会收进自己的档案馆网页，随时能翻。",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib/",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2 <0.3.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "dsh-ufo contributors",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ufo",
    "archive"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo/issues"
  }
}
